      "why": "permissions: profile \"jevlin\" with the writable roots, and network to agents-v1.nyks.dev, as.example.invalid and router.example.invalid only, through Codex's proxy (needs Codex 0.131.0 or newer)",
      "content": "# \u003e\u003e\u003e jevlin agents install \u003e\u003e\u003e\n# Codex permission profile for jevlin's search: write access to its jevlin\n# home and network access to the search hosts only, through Codex's proxy.\n# Needs Codex 0.131.0 or newer: an older Codex refuses this file with\n# \"invalid type: map, expected a boolean\" and does not start; remove\n# this block, or upgrade Codex.\ndefault_permissions = \"jevlin\"\n\n[features.network_proxy]\nenabled = true\n\n[permissions.jevlin]\nextends = \":workspace\"\n\n[permissions.jevlin.filesystem]\n\"TESTHOME/intake\" = \"write\"\n\"TESTHOME/sessions\" = \"write\"\n\"TESTHOME/spool\" = \"write\"\n\"TESTHOME/state\" = \"write\"\n\n[permissions.jevlin.network]\nenabled = true\n\n[permissions.jevlin.network.domains]\n\"agents-v1.nyks.dev\" = \"allow\"\n\"as.example.invalid\" = \"allow\"\n\"router.example.invalid\" = \"allow\"\n# \u003c\u003c\u003c jevlin agents install \u003c\u003c\u003c\n"
